// vr_distort_hud (vr_distort_hud_ps30 / vr_distort_hud_vs30) and
// vr_distort_texture (vr_distort_texture_ps30 / vr_distort_texture_vs30): the
// HUD inset into $distortbounds (directly, or through the distortion map with
// $hudundistort; opaque, or translucent with alpha test and blending), and the
// frame through the distortion map with and without $userendertarget.
